augh, if this helps. But she is very friendly and cool and likes video games. Thank you!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/sms2wf1ybjx9vgr2yu04k/h?dl=0&rlkey=aeq89pk4xbnhj7tomxdns5htr", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ZERO_XD5/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d292ccec/uploads/origins/6a9fe2db-13ae-46f8-8a21-6e59c90abb32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6073dc68a04c27329baf7b4a701b621", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d292ccec/uploads/origins/6a9fe2db-13ae-46f8-8a21-6e59c90abb32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6073dc68a04c27329baf7b4a701b621, https://si.imgix.net/d292ccec/uploads/origins/6a9fe2db-13ae-46f8-8a21-6e59c90abb32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43139b082bef4b4ddde3f45434ecaac8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d292ccec/uploads/origins/6a9fe2db-13ae-46f8-8a21-6e59c90abb32?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=79e2203dc41674360f41aa116c6c2512 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "依頼失礼します。\nSDキャラの男の子を描いてほしいです！\n服装はパーカーでお願いしたいです。構図などはどのような感じでも大丈夫です。\nまた、もし可能でしたらカメラを持たせて頂けると嬉しいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ZERO_XD5/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/633b185b/uploads/origins/f1ab9553-6015-42d1-b9f9-c5c6c89f61c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbc49f6a146ca8243c94cfa2fe86ceac", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/633b185b/uploads/origins/f1ab9553-6015-42d1-b9f9-c5c6c89f61c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbc49f6a146ca8243c94cfa2fe86ceac, https://si.imgix.net/633b185b/uploads/origins/f1ab9553-6015-42d1-b9f9-c5c6c89f61c9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cb45e2c481963cb0a1abfffc4237738 2x, https://si.imgix.net/633b185b/uploads/origins/f1ab9553-6015-42d1-b9f9-c5c6c89f61c9?bg=%23fff&a